  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "yuzu-01",
      "fanId": "yuzu",
      "title": "入河仪式",
      "postedDay": 1,
      "replyWindowDays": 7,
      "content": {
        "text": "{{idolName}}，第一次被翻到需要什么入河仪式吗？我已经把昵称改得很像老粉了。",
        "context": "保留两人最早的聊天记忆，用一条旧式翻牌建立她一路陪到总选月的氛围。"
      },
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "welcome",
          "text": "仪式就是：从今天开始别把自己当外人，来{{teamName}}也别紧张。",
          "cost": { "energy": 1, "mindset": 1 },
          "effects": { "affinity": { "yuzu": 10 }, "setFlags": ["yuzu-welcomed"] },
          "nextNodeId": "yuzu-02"
        },
        {
          "id": "playful",
          "text": "先交一份三百字入河感想，我明天检查。",
          "cost": { "energy": 1, "mindset": 1 },
          "effects": { "affinity": { "yuzu": 6 } },
          "nextNodeId": "yuzu-02"
        },
        {
          "id": "generic",
          "text": "我知道你刚来会有点紧张，也可能暂时分不清那些只有老粉才懂的梗。别急着把自己装得很熟。\n\n先按自己的节奏认识我，也认识这里的人。能来看看、愿意说句话，就已经算入河了。以后哪天累了，也不用为了证明喜欢硬撑。",
          "cost": { "energy": 1, "mindset": 1 },
          "effects": { "affinity": { "yuzu": 2 } },
          "nextNodeId": "yuzu-02"
        }
      ],
      "onExpire": { "affinity": { "yuzu": -8 }, "nextNodeId": "yuzu-02" },
      "editor": { "y": 0 }
    },
    {
      "id": "yuzu-02",
      "fanId": "yuzu",
      "title": "十二票",
      "postedDay": 10,
      "replyWindowDays": 7,
      "content": {
        "text": "我算了一下，暑假少买几杯奶茶，应该能给你投十二票。是不是有点少呀？别人好像随手就能投好多。"
      },
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "life-first",
          "text": "十二票不是你的大小。先好好吃饭、好好上学，能来陪我就已经很好了。",
          "cost": { "energy": 2, "mindset": 2 },
          "effects": { "affinity": { "yuzu": 12 }, "setFlags": ["yuzu-life-first"] },
          "nextNodeId": "yuzu-03"
        },
        {
          "id": "thank-votes",
          "text": "一点都不少，我会把你的十二票认真收好。",
          "cost": { "energy": 1, "mindset": 1 },
          "effects": { "affinity": { "yuzu": 7 } },
          "nextNodeId": "yuzu-03"
        },
        {
          "id": "push-more",
          "text": "现在十二票，月底说不定还能再努力一下？我相信你。",
          "cost": { "energy": 1, "mindset": 1 },
          "effects": {
            "affinity": { "yuzu": -12 },
            "popularity": -3,
            "setFlags": ["yuzu-pressured"]
          },
          "nextNodeId": "yuzu-03"
        }
      ],
      "onExpire": { "affinity": { "yuzu": -8 }, "nextNodeId": "yuzu-03" },
      "editor": { "y": 0 }
    },
    {
      "id": "yuzu-03",
      "fanId": "yuzu",
      "title": "半分钟和一整天",
      "postedDay": 19,
      "replyWindowDays": 7,
      "content": {
        "text": "今天握手只有两张券，我出来以后才发现自己紧张到只说了半句话。不过我在场馆站到散场，又远远看到你好几次！你有一次是不是往我这边挥手了？"
      },
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "remember-wave",
          "text": "是往你那边。我记得你今天头发上那个黄色发夹，半句话也有被我听见。",
          "cost": { "energy": 3, "mindset": 1 },
          "effects": { "affinity": { "yuzu": 13 }, "setFlags": ["yuzu-remembered"] },
          "nextNodeId": "yuzu-04"
        },
        {
          "id": "gentle-thanks",
          "text": "看到你啦，站一天很累吧？回去早点休息，下次不用这么紧张。",
          "cost": { "energy": 1, "mindset": 1 },
          "effects": { "affinity": { "yuzu": 7 } },
          "nextNodeId": "yuzu-04"
        },
        {
          "id": "template-reply",
          "text": "谢谢你来看公演，下次见！",
          "cost": { "energy": 1, "mindset": 1 },
          "effects": { "affinity": { "yuzu": 1 } },
          "nextNodeId": "yuzu-04"
        }
      ],
      "onExpire": { "affinity": { "yuzu": -10 }, "nextNodeId": "yuzu-04" },
      "editor": { "y": 0 }
    },
    {
      "id": "yuzu-04",
      "fanId": "yuzu",
      "title": "开学以后",
      "postedDay": 28,
      "replyWindowDays": 7,
      "content": {
        "text": "明天要开学啦。高三可能会很忙，以后不能每次都秒回你，也不一定常来看公演了。你总选要加油呀，我会把攒下来的票都投掉的。"
      },
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "remember-you",
          "text": "你先去过好自己的高三。不能秒回也没关系，我会记得那个每次都亮起来的头像。",
          "cost": { "energy": 3, "mindset": 2 },
          "effects": { "affinity": { "yuzu": 15 }, "setFlags": ["yuzu-stays"] }
        },
        {
          "id": "study-well",
          "text": "学习加油，照顾好自己。有空再见，我不会给你点名。",
          "cost": { "energy": 1, "mindset": 1 },
          "effects": { "affinity": { "yuzu": 8 }, "setFlags": ["yuzu-studies"] }
        },
        {
          "id": "votes-first",
          "text": "好，那记得先把票投完，之后就安心学习。",
          "cost": { "energy": 1, "mindset": 1 },
          "effects": { "affinity": { "yuzu": -10 } }
        }
      ],
      "onExpire": { "affinity": { "yuzu": -15 }, "setFlags": ["yuzu-left"] },
      "editor": { "y": 0 }
    },
    {
      "id": "salt-01",
      "fanId": "salt",
      "title": "超出粉丝的感情",
      "postedDay": 4,
      "replyWindowDays": 7,
      "content": {
        "text": "我最近一直在想……我好像对你产生了超出粉丝的感情。你每次回复我的时候，我都会觉得我们之间应该不只是普通偶像和粉丝吧？"
      },
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "gentle-boundary",
          "text": "谢谢你喜欢我，但我的回复是偶像对粉丝的回应。我们只能、也应该停在这个边界里。",
          "cost": { "energy": 2, "mindset": 4 },
          "effects": { "affinity": { "salt": -4 }, "setFlags": ["stalker-boundary"] },
          "nextNodeId": "salt-02"
        },
        {
          "id": "reassure-special",
          "text": "你当然很特别呀，我也会期待看到你的消息。",
          "cost": { "energy": 2, "mindset": 3 },
          "effects": { "affinity": { "salt": 10 }, "setFlags": ["stalker-encouraged"] },
          "nextNodeId": "salt-02"
        },
        {
          "id": "hard-stop",
          "text": "这种话让我不舒服，以后不要再说了。",
          "cost": { "energy": 1, "mindset": 5 },
          "effects": { "affinity": { "salt": -12 }, "setFlags": ["stalker-boundary"] },
          "nextNodeId": "salt-02"
        }
      ],
      "onExpire": { "affinity": { "salt": -5 }, "nextNodeId": "salt-02" },
      "editor": { "y": 240 }
    },
    {
      "id": "salt-02",
      "fanId": "salt",
      "title": "火锅店的巧合",
      "postedDay": 10,
      "replyWindowDays": 7,
      "content": {
        "text": "刚才火锅店那个真的是你吧？没想到会这么巧！我怕打扰你就没过去，只在隔壁桌看了一会儿。你是不是也看到我了？"
      },
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "ask-source",
          "text": "你怎么知道我在那里？那不是公开行程。请不要再跟着我，也不要在私人时间观察我。",
          "cost": { "energy": 2, "mindset": 5 },
          "effects": { "affinity": { "salt": -10 }, "setFlags": ["stalker-documented"] },
          "nextNodeId": "salt-03"
        },
        {
          "id": "tell-organizer",
          "text": "我看到了，而且有点害怕。我会把这次情况告诉应援会和公司，请你不要再出现。",
          "cost": { "energy": 3, "mindset": 5 },
          "effects": {
            "affinity": { "salt": -12, "lighthouse": 5 },
            "setFlags": ["stalker-documented", "organizer-knows"]
          },
          "nextNodeId": "salt-03"
        },
        {
          "id": "brush-off",
          "text": "原来真的是你，好巧。下次在外面不用等我啦。",
          "cost": { "energy": 1, "mindset": 3 },
          "effects": { "affinity": { "salt": 6 } },
          "nextNodeId": "salt-03"
        }
      ],
      "onExpire": { "affinity": { "salt": -6 }, "nextNodeId": "salt-03" },
      "editor": { "y": 240 }
    },
    {
      "id": "salt-03",
      "fanId": "salt",
      "title": "商场里的第二次",
      "postedDay": 16,
      "replyWindowDays": 7,
      "content": {
        "text": "今天商场又遇到你了。你走得好快，我喊了两声都没回头。别紧张，我只是担心你一个人逛街不安全，所以想离你近一点。"
      },
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "official-report",
          "text": "让我不安全的正是这种跟踪。我已经保存记录并上报公司，以后不要接近我的私人行程。",
          "cost": { "energy": 2, "mindset": 6 },
          "effects": { "affinity": { "salt": -18 }, "setFlags": ["stalker-official"] },
          "nextNodeId": "salt-04"
        },
        {
          "id": "ask-organizer-help",
          "text": "这不是偶遇。我会把记录交给夜航灯塔和公司，只通过正式渠道处理。",
          "cost": { "energy": 3, "mindset": 5 },
          "effects": {
            "affinity": { "salt": -15, "lighthouse": 8 },
            "setFlags": ["stalker-official", "organizer-knows"]
          },
          "nextNodeId": "salt-04"
        },
        {
          "id": "cold-down",
          "text": "我不讨论私人行程。之后这类消息我不会再回复。",
          "cost": { "energy": 1, "mindset": 4 },
          "effects": { "affinity": { "salt": -8 }, "setFlags": ["stalker-cold"] },
          "nextNodeId": "salt-04"
        },
        {
          "id": "appease-again",
          "text": "我只是没听见。谢谢你担心，不过下次别跟这么近。",
          "cost": { "energy": 3, "mindset": 6 },
          "effects": { "affinity": { "salt": 8 }, "setFlags": ["stalker-appeased"] },
          "nextNodeId": "salt-04"
        }
      ],
      "onExpire": { "affinity": { "salt": -7 }, "nextNodeId": "salt-04" },
      "editor": { "y": 240 }
    },
    {
      "id": "salt-04",
      "fanId": "salt",
      "title": "你是不是要拉黑我",
      "postedDay": 22,
      "replyWindowDays": 2,
      "content": {
        "text": "你最近为什么这么冷淡？是不是夜航灯塔和你说了什么，还准备把我拉黑？我为你做了这么多，你不能一句话都不给我。"
      },
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "block-officially",
          "text": "这是最后一次回复。你的跟踪已经越过底线，之后公司会按安全事件处理。",
          "cost": { "energy": 2, "mindset": 6 },
          "effects": {
            "affinity": { "salt": -20 },
            "setFlags": ["stalker-blocked", "stalker-official"]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "trust-core-fans",
          "text": "我会停止联系，也会把证据交给可信任的人。大家只做事实澄清，不会公开你的私人信息。",
          "cost": { "energy": 4, "mindset": 5 },
          "effects": {
            "affinity": { "salt": -18, "lighthouse": 8 },
            "setFlags": ["stalker-blocked", "stalker-supported", "organizer-knows"]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "silent-block",
          "text": "我不会再讨论这件事。请停止接近我的私人生活。",
          "cost": { "energy": 1, "mindset": 4 },
          "effects": { "affinity": { "salt": -12 }, "setFlags": ["stalker-cold"] }
        },
        {
          "id": "keep-appeasing",
          "text": "没有人说你不好，我只是最近太忙了。别多想，我看到消息还是会回的。",
          "cost": { "energy": 4, "mindset": 7 },
          "effects": { "affinity": { "salt": 10 }, "setFlags": ["stalker-appeased"] }
        }
      ],
      "onExpire": {
        "affinity": { "salt": -15 },
        "setFlags": ["stalker-ignored"]
      },
      "editor": { "y": 240 }
    },
    {
